cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to these negative results or reuse the study code, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "Ashfall: a negative-results study of failure-driven robot learning and simulator diagnosis"
abstract: >-
  Archived research program on failure-driven policy repair and simulator diagnosis. Five
  preregistered CPU toy studies (failure-boundary replay, precursor replay, recoverability-guided
  replay, failure-critical system identification, active simulator diagnosis) each returned
  NO-GO against strong baselines. No method was run in Isaac Lab or on quadruped hardware.
authors:
